e of throttling, or establish noise-free causal speedup. These qualifications constrain publication claims rather than discard unfavorable data.\n\nR131 session01 is wholly REJECTED: A1/B1/B2 completed, then the A2 premeasurement guard saw cargo-nextest/cargo/rustc and refused before any A2 measurements. No session01 sample is reused. The byte-exact failed driver log, rejection receipt, and recorded busy-process receipt are copied into this review. failed-session01-manifest.json hashes all 108 preserved failed-session files at their original external locations. Session02 is a new complete four-run ABBA sequence, not fast-side selection.\n\nExternal data-only receipts include recomputed-results.json, source-binary-invocation-receipts.json, host-review.json, input-artifact-manifest.json, build-receipts-manifest.json, failed-session manifests/receipts and REVIEW.sha256. All 218 accepted session files are hash-checked unchanged across this review. No duplicate build targets or executable binaries were copied. Only this external review directory was written. No repository edits, new measurements, builds, proofs, process control, or policy execution occurred. Reference: holzman-rust references/latency-throughput-playbook.md. Canonical policy and publisher CODE acceptance remain separate.\n\n--- UNMODIFIED RAW TEXT {\"decoded_sha256\": \"b66fabbded4311e421c6597294cf8197f784fb017f8a79e5ce4173873f983be0\", \"raw_path\": \"/home/lewis/tmp/vb-f1f5-final-benchmark-r131/session02/01-A1/engine_run_until_blocked_budget_10_small_workflow/criterion.log\", \"representation\": \"gzip\", \"stored_path\": \"evidence/benchmark-runs/r131-072e8ddd-session02/session/01-A1/engine_run_until_blocked_budget_10_small_workflow/criterion.log.gz\", \"stored_sha256\": \"8795bb3a4c89feaa0e0d3d0eded4025ff02e6fa7dfb9af9c9aa1b2768a75c57e\"} ---\nGnuplot not found, using plotters backend\nBenchmarking runtime_core/engine_run_until_blocked_budget_10_small_workflow;profile=bench;tool=criterion-0.8;dura...\